   plot="The book distinguishes the beautiful from the merely pleasant and the merely interesting, explains beauty as the satisfaction of the mind's demand for unity in variety, and treats the arts as the deliberate organisation of that satisfaction, in a compact argument that draws on her earlier physiological and psychological work.",
