   plot="The essays move through the seasons and the kinds of country — the meadow, the wood, the hedgerow, the brook, the fields after harvest — recording the flowers, the birds, the insects and the farm work with an exactness that turns observation into a kind of prayer, and ending with the great essay on the wind and the sun.",
